<title>DENMARK: TENNIS-COPENHAGEN OPEN SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-COPENHAGEN OPEN SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round results in the $203,000 Copenhagen Open ATP tournament on Thursday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Tomas Carbonell (Spain) beat 7-Kenneth Carlsen (Denmark) 7-6 (7-5) 7-6 (9-7)</p>
<p>Frederik Fetterlein (Denmark) beat Filip Dewulf (Belgium) 6-3 7-6 (7-1)</p>
</text>
